<title>SPAIN: Spain May M4 rose provisional 8.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain May M4 rose provisional 8.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		    MAY 97     APR 97     MAR 97</p>
<p> M4 pct rise			8.5	  0.3	   2.6</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise    11.3	  9.5	  10.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis. Revised figures for previous months will follow later.</p>
</text>
